1
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,030
I wonder if it's because

2
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:54,470
the Crown Princess is expecting,

3
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:57,030
but she seems much gentler today.

4
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,070
Indeed.

5
00:00:58,240 --> 00:00:59,670
She's usually so reserved

6
00:00:59,670 --> 00:01:00,560
and so aloof.

7
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,350
Yet today, she hasn't stopped smiling.

8
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,280
At a time

9
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,840
of such uncertainty,

10
00:01:41,230 --> 00:01:44,040
His Majesty's health
isn't what it used to be.

11
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:46,200
We'll keep everything simple.

12
00:01:46,710 --> 00:01:49,200
Today is just a family gathering.

13
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,350
Everyone,

14
00:01:50,464 --> 00:01:51,790
please make yourselves at home.

15
00:01:52,710 --> 00:01:55,000
Prince Lie is on duty today.

16
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:55,920
Send him

17
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:57,510
some dishes.

18
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,640
That way,

19
00:02:00,928 --> 00:02:02,870
he can still share
in this family celebration.

20
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:04,680
Come.

21
00:02:10,544 --> 00:02:12,550
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

22
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:15,150
- May Your Majesty enjoy everlasting health.
- May Your Majesty enjoy everlasting health.

23
00:02:15,184 --> 00:02:17,776
- May you live as long as heaven and earth.
- May you live as long as heaven and earth.

24
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,680
Come.

25
00:02:38,336 --> 00:02:39,910
Please continue chatting, everyone.

26
00:02:39,910 --> 00:02:40,960
I'll go freshen up

27
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,870
and be right back.

28
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,280
Your Highness!

29
00:02:57,910 --> 00:02:58,750
Someone, hurry!

30
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,870
Assassins!

31
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:04,360
There are assassins!

32
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:06,000
Someone, hurry!

33
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,560
Protect His Majesty!

34
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,800
Where are the East Palace guards?

35
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:33,680
Your Highness.

36
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:37,400
Protect Mother and the ladies first.

37
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,120
Qing, be careful.

38
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,360
Tian Yuan.

39
00:03:42,370 --> 00:03:44,000
Escort the Crown Princess
to the side hall.

40
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,310
Yes.

41
00:03:44,310 --> 00:03:45,120
I'll stay with you.

42
00:03:45,910 --> 00:03:46,470
Don't worry.

43
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:47,590
Take care of yourself.

44
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,430
Tian Yuan.

45
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:48,960
Yes.

46
00:05:19,968 --> 00:05:20,780
=Blossoms of Power=

47
00:05:20,784 --> 00:05:23,700
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

48
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:26,740
=Episode 32=

49
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:30,830
Quick!

50
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:37,160
Attack!

51
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,800
Changqing!

52
00:06:00,832 --> 00:06:02,290
Go protect the Grand Empress Dowager!

53
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:06,360
Your Majesty, your safety comes first.

54
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,160
We should leave now.

55
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:34,120
Quick, keep up!

56
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,270
Tian Yuan.

57
00:06:43,504 --> 00:06:44,630
Go protect the Crown Prince.

58
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:45,710
But His Highness told me...

59
00:06:45,728 --> 00:06:46,800
I can protect myself.

60
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,360
Go now.

61
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,120
Yes.

62
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:48,800
Go.

63
00:07:00,352 --> 00:07:02,120
Although Changtai
is nowhere to be found,

64
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,240
he harbors deep resentment.

65
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,496
He won't let this end so easily.

66
00:07:04,528 --> 00:07:05,860
He's already at the end of his rope.

67
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:07,420
The Imperial Guard
is heavily guarding the palace.

68
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,720
How could anything still go wrong?

69
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,040
It's because
he's at the end of his rope

70
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,660
that he won't care
about the consequences.

71
00:07:11,670 --> 00:07:12,950
If anything happens in the palace,

72
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:15,060
I'll have someone send up
a flaming arrow as a signal.

73
00:07:15,072 --> 00:07:16,656
You must bring the troops here at once.

74
00:07:17,390 --> 00:07:18,240
Rest assured, Huayong.

75
00:07:18,630 --> 00:07:19,270
Follow me.

76
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:20,430
- Yes!
- Yes!

77
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,560
Quick!

78
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,800
Bar the door!

79
00:07:31,888 --> 00:07:32,960
Find something heavy, too.

80
00:07:32,976 --> 00:07:34,040
- Brace the door!
- Yes.

81
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:34,480
Yes.

82
00:07:35,310 --> 00:07:35,950
Use this.

83
00:07:35,984 --> 00:07:37,168
- This one.
- Over here.

84
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,070
Quick, help me!

85
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:39,870
- Hurry!
- Here.

86
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:42,920
This one.

87
00:07:43,510 --> 00:07:44,000
Move!

88
00:07:46,310 --> 00:07:47,000
Put it here.

89
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:47,950
Okay.

90
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:53,800
Xihe.

91
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,430
Quick!

92
00:07:54,510 --> 00:07:55,800
Come stand over here.

93
00:07:55,870 --> 00:07:56,830
You're with child.

94
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:57,950
Don't go any closer.

95
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:01,360
Mother.

96
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:03,560
What should we do now?

97
00:08:03,870 --> 00:08:05,190
Judging by what just happened,

98
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,950
I'm afraid there's a traitor among us.

99
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,750
They've colluded with the Palace Guard.

100
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,190
I'm afraid they're staging a rebellion.

101
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:13,600
What are we going to do?

102
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,190
Stop crying.

103
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,270
The guards are fighting
in the main hall.

104
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:20,190
They can't spare anyone to rescue us.

105
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:22,000
There is no back exit here.

106
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:23,720
There's no way out.

107
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:25,120
What could

108
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,830
be more frightening than death?

109
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:30,390
At a time like this,

110
00:08:30,870 --> 00:08:32,360
what do we still have to fear?

111
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,360
What are you doing?

112
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,750
These gold hairpins

113
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,270
are usually just ornaments.

114
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,390
But now,

115
00:08:42,832 --> 00:08:45,056
they can also serve as weapons
to defend ourselves.

116
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,510
Good.

117
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,750
Rather than sit here and wait to die,

118
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,600
we should

119
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,550
fight to the death.

120
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,000
Any daughters of military families

121
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,608
trained in martial arts, step forward.

122
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:02,960
We'll hold the front.

123
00:09:03,510 --> 00:09:04,480
Everyone else,

124
00:09:04,490 --> 00:09:05,600
fall back to the rear steps.

125
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,390
- Yes.
- Yes.

126
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:29,120
Zhen Zhu, Mo Yu.

127
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,750
Collect everyone's sachets.

128
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:31,480
- Yes.
- Yes.

129
00:09:35,670 --> 00:09:36,150
Here.

130
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,910
Your Highness.

131
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,750
Keep these three.

132
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:46,310
I'm going to prepare an incense blend.

133
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:46,896
- Yes.
- Yes.

134
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:16,030
Huayong.

135
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:38,000
Father.

136
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,240
I trust you've been well.

137
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,440
You ungrateful son!

138
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:46,150
How could you commit such a heinous act?

139
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,200
Is there

140
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:50,360
any sense of human decency left in you?

141
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,630
Human decency?

142
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:55,080
You married me off to a foreign kingdom

143
00:10:55,510 --> 00:10:57,080
and cut off my path to the throne.

144
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,030
Later, after I'd let go of my obsession

145
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,270
and Yanhui and I had fallen in love,

146
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:02,960
you ordered me

147
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:05,240
to treat her as an enemy

148
00:11:05,424 --> 00:11:08,032
and forbade me from feeling
the slightest affection for her.

149
00:11:08,910 --> 00:11:10,080
In your eyes,

150
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,180
I was never anything
more than a living sacrifice,

151
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:14,720
a tool without flesh or blood.

152
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:18,150
When have you ever
shown me a father's love?

153
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:19,960
When...

154
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:23,840
When have you ever truly
loved me as your son?

155
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,750
Shut up!

156
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:25,960
I,

157
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,870
as the Emperor of Daxing,

158
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:32,030
must bear the burden of the nation.

159
00:11:32,150 --> 00:11:33,790
Born into the imperial family,

160
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:37,360
the sovereign
always comes before the father.

161
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:38,790
You,

162
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,150
care only about
your personal grievances.

163
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,480
When have you ever understood

164
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,670
the burdens of being
an emperor and a father?

165
00:11:54,390 --> 00:11:55,270
Huayong.

166
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,840
Open your eyes.

167
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,510
This is our good father.

168
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:03,000
All he sees is his throne,

169
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,600
his realm, and his power.

170
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,670
To him, we sons

171
00:12:08,270 --> 00:12:10,790
are nothing more than pawns

172
00:12:11,150 --> 00:12:13,440
to be weighed and sacrificed at will!

173
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:17,440
Fine.

174
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:18,550
Father.

175
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,150
Then today,

176
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:21,870
I will

177
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:24,240
put an end to all of this!

178
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,630
Huayong.

179
00:12:29,270 --> 00:12:31,030
Now that you know the truth,

180
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,080
why do you still try to stop me?

181
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:34,000
Changtai.

182
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,750
If you stop now,

183
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,000
there's still a way out.

184
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:38,750
Even now,

185
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,030
you still believe his lies?

186
00:12:41,630 --> 00:12:42,960
You're beyond saving.

187
00:13:50,750 --> 00:13:52,440
Prince Lie. I am Zhao Zhenghao.

188
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,380
Upon seeing the signal,

189
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:54,840
I came under the Crown Prince's orders

190
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,620
with Embroidered Envoys
to rescue His Majesty.

191
00:13:56,630 --> 00:13:57,150
Good.

192
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:57,790
Follow me.

193
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:58,510
Move!

194
00:13:59,240 --> 00:13:59,720
Quick!

195
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,600
Your Majesty!

196
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:32,510
Guards!

197
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:36,750
Your Majesty!

198
00:14:36,910 --> 00:14:38,080
Watch out!

199
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:44,240
San Zhi!

200
00:14:51,750 --> 00:14:52,720
San Zhi!

201
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:21,440
Huayong.

202
00:15:29,550 --> 00:15:30,360
Huayong.

203
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,080
Huayong!

204
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,030
Father!

205
00:15:50,510 --> 00:15:51,150
Your Highness!

206
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:52,270
We can't win this.

207
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,120
Retreat now!

208
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,270
Huayong.

209
00:15:58,510 --> 00:15:59,910
Retreat!

210
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:03,320
Huayong!

211
00:16:03,536 --> 00:16:04,720
- Your Highness!
- Huayong!

212
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:09,960
Protect His Majesty!

213
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:10,550
Yes.

214
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,030
Everyone, follow me!

215
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,840
- Yes.
- Yes.

216
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:29,960
Changtai.

217
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:31,360
Changtai.

218
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:32,720
Stop now.

219
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,790
For the sake of our brotherhood,

220
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,720
I won't kill you.

221
00:16:49,152 --> 00:16:51,984
Go before Father
and confess your crimes yourself.

222
00:17:21,590 --> 00:17:22,550
Changying.

223
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,880
I've always envied you.

224
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:30,680
Although you were never
Father's favorite son,

225
00:17:33,590 --> 00:17:36,240
you grew up under
your own brother's protection.

226
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,830
No wonder you're so innocent.

227
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:45,400
I am Father's son, too.

228
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,160
Yet now,

229
00:17:50,070 --> 00:17:51,920
I have become

230
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:55,510
a traitor everyone in Daxing wants dead.

231
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:08,750
When did I ever have any brothers?

232
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,480
When...

233
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:16,070
When did I ever have a father?

234
00:18:23,350 --> 00:18:25,160
I was nothing more than
a living sacrifice,

235
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,310
a bargaining chip
to be weighed and traded.

236
00:18:49,750 --> 00:18:50,640
Yanyan.

237
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:55,310
I'm coming.

238
00:18:59,830 --> 00:19:01,000
Changtai!

239
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:02,310
Changtai!

240
00:19:58,070 --> 00:19:58,830
Yanyan.

241
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:02,720
Yanyan.

242
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:11,000
All your life,

243
00:20:12,160 --> 00:20:13,750
you've always yielded to me.

244
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:17,790
You've suffered so much.

245
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,880
No matter how reluctant I am,

246
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,510
this time,

247
00:20:27,070 --> 00:20:28,070
I'll do as you wish.

248
00:20:43,550 --> 00:20:44,350
Yanyan.

249
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,720
Yanyan.

250
00:21:25,350 --> 00:21:26,110
Changtai.

251
00:21:28,240 --> 00:21:28,960
Farewell.

252
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:35,350
Huayong.

253
00:21:35,488 --> 00:21:37,440
I'll go find
the Imperial Physician for you.

254
00:21:37,550 --> 00:21:39,110
Rest here in the main hall.

255
00:21:41,024 --> 00:21:41,920
There's no need...

256
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,440
I want to ask you something.

257
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:55,960
Go ahead.

258
00:21:57,550 --> 00:21:58,720
Who was it,

259
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,480
that poisoned me?

260
00:22:05,510 --> 00:22:06,830
I want to know.

261
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:08,400
That person...

262
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,720
was it really you?

263
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:14,070
Huayong.

264
00:22:14,310 --> 00:22:14,960
Huayong.

265
00:22:26,350 --> 00:22:27,640
Over the years,

266
00:22:28,830 --> 00:22:30,440
I've suspected many people,

267
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:35,960
but I never suspected you.

268
00:22:39,830 --> 00:22:41,510
And more than anything,

269
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:44,960
I hoped it wasn't you.

270
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:47,830
So today,

271
00:22:49,400 --> 00:22:51,310
I want to hear it from you.

272
00:22:53,920 --> 00:22:54,830
That person...

273
00:22:56,680 --> 00:22:57,720
who was it?

274
00:22:59,030 --> 00:23:00,680
Was it really you?

275
00:23:05,750 --> 00:23:06,510
Huayong.

276
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,720
It wasn't me.

277
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:14,550
I didn't poison you.

278
00:23:18,030 --> 00:23:20,640
I never once intended to harm you.

279
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:26,750
If a single word I say is false,

280
00:23:28,070 --> 00:23:30,160
I'd rather die by your sword.

281
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:48,880
Huayong.

282
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,200
For more than ten years,

283
00:23:51,550 --> 00:23:54,030
I've searched tirelessly
for the culprit.

284
00:23:56,270 --> 00:23:57,440
Sadly,

285
00:23:57,960 --> 00:23:59,830
there's still no trace of them.

286
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,590
Huayong,

287
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:07,110
I have failed you.

288
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:10,240
Huayong.

289
00:24:13,830 --> 00:24:14,720
Huayong.

290
00:24:18,000 --> 00:24:18,880
Huayong.

291
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,110
Father.

292
00:24:29,350 --> 00:24:30,550
Father.

293
00:24:32,510 --> 00:24:33,790
I'll never forget

294
00:24:35,550 --> 00:24:37,070
that after I was poisoned,

295
00:24:38,510 --> 00:24:40,550
I was bedridden for months.

296
00:24:42,830 --> 00:24:44,790
Apart from attending court,

297
00:24:45,750 --> 00:24:47,790
you stayed in the East Palace
day and night

298
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,000
to care for me.

299
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:54,720
You held me in your arms as I lay dying

300
00:24:56,110 --> 00:24:57,680
and knelt at every ancestral shrine.

301
00:25:00,310 --> 00:25:02,270
Your fatherly love

302
00:25:03,270 --> 00:25:04,400
is still vivid in my mind.

303
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:09,110
If not for your love,

304
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:12,960
I would never have lived to this day.

305
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:19,400
If you say you didn't do it,

306
00:25:22,160 --> 00:25:23,590
then I believe you.

307
00:25:30,590 --> 00:25:31,680
Huayong.

308
00:25:34,350 --> 00:25:35,680
My Huayong.

309
00:25:46,590 --> 00:25:48,350
I have failed you.

310
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,920
Grand Empress Dowager,
are you all right?

311
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,400
I'm fine.

312
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,624
Where's the Crown Prince?

313
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:12,368
He's been in the main hall with Father.

314
00:26:13,270 --> 00:26:13,790
Xihe!

315
00:26:14,750 --> 00:26:15,270
Mother.

316
00:27:16,030 --> 00:27:16,750
Huayong.

317
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:19,440
What are you doing?

318
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,400
Father.

319
00:27:24,440 --> 00:27:25,720
My condition

320
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:29,350
is beyond cure.

321
00:27:39,830 --> 00:27:41,350
I beg you, Father,

322
00:27:43,400 --> 00:27:45,480
to grant the child in Xihe's womb

323
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:48,350
the name Junshu.

324
00:27:49,030 --> 00:27:50,030
Junshu?

325
00:27:54,270 --> 00:27:55,920
This is a name reserved for an emperor.

326
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,720
I...

327
00:28:01,350 --> 00:28:02,790
understand your intention.

328
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:06,160
You wish to secure a safeguard

329
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:08,160
for Xihe and your child.

330
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:16,590
How difficult life will be

331
00:28:17,790 --> 00:28:20,310
for the Crown Princess
of the East Palace without her husband,

332
00:28:21,904 --> 00:28:24,464
and for the young heir
of the East Palace without his father.

333
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:30,350
My final wish

334
00:28:32,110 --> 00:28:34,070
is that Xihe and our child

335
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:36,830
may live in peace

336
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:39,400
and be safe year after year.

337
00:28:41,030 --> 00:28:42,440
I beg you to grant my wish.

338
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:49,720
Huayong.

339
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,310
I promise you.

340
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:04,070
Whether it's a boy or a girl,

341
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,350
the child shall be named Junshu.

342
00:29:07,750 --> 00:29:09,310
Thank you, Father, for granting my wish.

343
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,200
Come.

344
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,640
Where are you going?

345
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:57,310
To find Xihe.

346
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:23,910
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

347
00:30:23,910 --> 00:30:26,540
♪The story is sketched anew♪

348
00:30:26,540 --> 00:30:30,180
♪The moonlight
is sewn together by the dusk♪

349
00:30:31,630 --> 00:30:34,400
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

350
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:37,130
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

351
00:30:37,130 --> 00:30:41,610
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

352
00:30:42,250 --> 00:30:44,890
♪I step onto this winding path♪

353
00:30:44,890 --> 00:30:47,230
♪What was swept away?♪

354
00:30:47,420 --> 00:30:51,590
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

355
00:30:52,630 --> 00:30:55,200
♪The clouds twist into a vortex♪

356
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:57,950
♪Reaching out to touch you♪

357
00:30:57,950 --> 00:31:02,730
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

358
00:31:03,910 --> 00:31:06,180
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

359
00:31:06,180 --> 00:31:09,050
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

360
00:31:09,050 --> 00:31:11,420
♪The stars are sinking♪

361
00:31:11,420 --> 00:31:14,420
♪Like a sunken vow♪

362
00:31:14,910 --> 00:31:17,590
♪You drifted away alone♪

363
00:31:18,220 --> 00:31:22,660
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

364
00:31:23,530 --> 00:31:26,140
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

365
00:31:26,140 --> 00:31:30,410
♪I can only stay there forever♪

366
00:31:30,410 --> 00:31:35,640
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

367
00:31:35,840 --> 00:31:38,050
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

368
00:31:38,480 --> 00:31:42,450
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

369
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:44,460
(Jade Terrace and Auspicious Dew)

370
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:49,750
Xihe.

371
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,590
It's so good to see you.

372
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:56,590
Your Highness.

373
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,750
Let me take you
to the Imperial Physician.

374
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:00,790
Don't go, all right?

375
00:33:03,750 --> 00:33:05,750
I want to talk to you.

376
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:15,720
I've imagined countless times

377
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:20,440
what my final moments would be like.

378
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:25,070
But I never imagined

379
00:33:27,510 --> 00:33:29,510
they would be this beautiful.

380
00:33:33,640 --> 00:33:35,160
The one I love

381
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:36,960
is right before me.

382
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:42,400
We're watching the snow together.

383
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:46,310
It's beautiful.

384
00:34:01,640 --> 00:34:02,960
Xihe.

385
00:34:06,830 --> 00:34:08,960
Do you still remember

386
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:13,000
the day the maple leaves
were at their reddest?

387
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:21,550
After our afternoon nap,

388
00:34:23,630 --> 00:34:25,920
we quietly

389
00:34:27,550 --> 00:34:29,510
drank plum juice together.

390
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,150
By the little window,

391
00:34:40,320 --> 00:34:41,960
with the gentle breeze drifting in...

392
00:34:44,550 --> 00:34:46,590
That simple kind of life

393
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,840
was life's greatest blessing.

394
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:59,150
Your Highness.

395
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,840
We promised

396
00:35:06,360 --> 00:35:07,360
that this year,

397
00:35:10,550 --> 00:35:13,000
we'd watch
the maple leaves together again.

398
00:35:14,400 --> 00:35:15,280
Next year,

399
00:35:19,510 --> 00:35:21,710
we'd count
the apricot blossoms together.

400
00:35:23,150 --> 00:35:24,320
Year after year,

401
00:35:25,550 --> 00:35:26,800
we'd stay by each other's side.

402
00:35:46,190 --> 00:35:47,630
Xihe.

403
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,230
I'm afraid

404
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:55,190
I have to break that promise.

405
00:35:58,440 --> 00:36:01,760
I barged into your life,

406
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:05,440
only to leave before you.

407
00:36:09,710 --> 00:36:10,670
I'm sorry.

408
00:36:14,070 --> 00:36:15,550
I only hope

409
00:36:20,190 --> 00:36:21,440
you'll never

410
00:36:22,670 --> 00:36:24,550
regret marrying me...

411
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:48,440
Marrying you in this life

412
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:51,070
is something I will

413
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:53,030
never regret.

414
00:37:00,350 --> 00:37:06,060
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

415
00:37:07,500 --> 00:37:13,400
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom
is more than wind and sand♪

416
00:37:14,480 --> 00:37:20,070
♪That perfectly plotted love
hides in the clamor♪

417
00:37:21,520 --> 00:37:27,020
♪Between us, it's both
treacherous and flawless♪

418
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:33,930
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

419
00:37:34,330 --> 00:37:42,080
♪As night stains my eyes, I'll gaze
once more at the rosy clouds♪

420
00:37:42,330 --> 00:37:45,710
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

421
00:37:45,910 --> 00:37:49,270
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

422
00:37:49,470 --> 00:37:52,810
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

423
00:37:52,810 --> 00:37:56,400
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

424
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:59,670
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

425
00:37:59,810 --> 00:38:03,360
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

426
00:38:03,360 --> 00:38:06,930
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

427
00:38:06,930 --> 00:38:13,380
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

428
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:17,190
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

429
00:38:17,190 --> 00:38:20,850
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

430
00:38:20,850 --> 00:38:24,280
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

431
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:27,820
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

432
00:38:27,820 --> 00:38:31,070
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

433
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:34,750
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

434
00:38:34,750 --> 00:38:38,290
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

435
00:38:38,290 --> 00:38:41,450
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

436
00:38:46,940 --> 00:38:49,030
♪May the sand and dirt in my sleeves♪

437
00:38:49,270 --> 00:38:51,950
♪Become the tears
in the corner of my eyes♪

438
00:38:52,090 --> 00:38:55,160
♪And blossom into a flower♪

439
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,230
What he could do,

440
00:39:07,550 --> 00:39:08,480
I can do as well.

441
00:39:08,630 --> 00:39:09,760
From beginning to end,

442
00:39:10,190 --> 00:39:11,710
I have always been your husband.

443
00:39:11,710 --> 00:39:13,150
Why was it Xiao Huayong,

444
00:39:13,150 --> 00:39:14,190
and not me?

445
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:15,510
In this world,

446
00:39:15,510 --> 00:39:17,280
no one can compare to him.

447
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:19,150
If even the gods refuse to save me,

448
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,760
then I'll save myself.

449
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:22,230
Shen Xihe.

450
00:39:22,230 --> 00:39:24,110
She will become my consort.

451
00:39:28,710 --> 00:39:31,650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

452
00:39:32,270 --> 00:39:35,070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

453
00:39:35,940 --> 00:39:42,910
♪So never uncover♪

454
00:39:43,100 --> 00:39:45,460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

455
00:39:46,590 --> 00:39:49,320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

456
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:55,620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

457
00:39:57,380 --> 00:40:00,200
♪Every answer I gave♪

458
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:03,850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

459
00:40:04,640 --> 00:40:08,010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

460
00:40:08,270 --> 00:40:11,580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

461
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:17,990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

462
00:40:18,980 --> 00:40:21,310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

463
00:40:22,580 --> 00:40:28,340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

464
00:40:29,750 --> 00:40:32,880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

465
00:40:33,330 --> 00:40:36,340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

466
00:40:36,450 --> 00:40:43,090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

467
00:40:43,090 --> 00:40:46,760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

468
00:40:47,630 --> 00:40:50,390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

469
00:40:50,830 --> 00:40:53,960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

470
00:40:54,400 --> 00:41:00,350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

471
00:41:01,750 --> 00:41:05,300
♪You'll never♪

472
00:41:05,580 --> 00:41:15,050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

473
00:41:41,220 --> 00:41:44,700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)

